<title>SWEDEN: Riksbank repo drains 44 bln SKR from market.</title>
<headline>Riksbank repo drains 44 bln SKR from market.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's Riksbank said it drained 44 billion crowns from the market in Tuesday morning's reverse repurchase operation.</p>
<p>The operation was set at an unchanged, fixed 4.60 percent and will run from November 20 to November 27, replacing an operation that drained 56 billion crowns from the market.</p>
<p>The Riksbank said 11.64 percent of the bids for the tender were allocated.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
